    <string name="info_zakat_on_crops_and_fruits">Crops and fruits are what is measured or weighed and stored from agricultural crops and what is food for people, such as: dates and raisins. Zakat must be paid immediately after the harvest.</string>
    <string name="info_zakat_on_livestock">It should be taken into account that zakat is obligatory on all of them, including those born during the year.\nThe correct opinion is that it should be intact and not known at the expense of its owner.</string>
    <string name="info_zakat_on_professional">It is the net income of the profession, if it reaches the quorum and one year has passed.</string>
    <string name="info_zakat_on_revenue">Exploited assets, such as: real estate and rented cars, as well as devices and equipment that generate income, and their zakat is due if the revenue reaches the quorum and one year has passed.\nAnd there is no zakat on the exploited property.</string>
    <string name="info_zakat_on_dates">The program requires the availability of the number of fruitful date palms that a person owns, whether they are in homes or on farms.</string>
